{"title": "Cloud Giant Finger", "pageid": 14520, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cloud_Giant_Finger", "categories": ["Alchemical ingredients", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cloud_Giant_Finger_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Cloud_Giant_Finger_Icon.png/300px-Cloud_Giant_Finger_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/6/6e/Cloud_Giant_Finger_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Cloud Giant Finger image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Cloud_Giant_Finger_Icon.png/300px-Cloud_Giant_Finger_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Cloud_Giant_Finger_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Cloud Giant Finger</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemical Ingredient</a>. Combine 3 of these to grind them into <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Cloud_Giant_Fingernails\" title=\"Salts of Cloud Giant Fingernails\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Extract_Green_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Green_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Extract_Green_Salts_Item_Icon.png/30px-Extract_Green_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Extract_Green_Salts_Item_Icon.png/40px-Extract_Green_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Extract_Green_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Green_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Extract_Green_Salts_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Cloud_Giant_Fingernails\" title=\"Salts of Cloud Giant Fingernails\">Salts of Cloud Giant Fingernails</a>, which is used to make <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Elixir of Cloud Giant Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Elixir of Cloud Giant Strength\">Elixir of Cloud Giant Strength</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The blood on this finger has clotted in strange swirling patterns - like a grotesque facsimile of cumulus clouds.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alchemical_Ingredients\" title=\"Alchemical Ingredients\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/38px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/50px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alchemical Ingredients\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemical_Ingredients\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Alchemical Ingredients\">Alchemical Ingredients</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 45 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  45  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-6d55a8364bf4b2d4END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-657991bd673c8a25END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Ingredient_Loot_CloudGiantFinger</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Ingredient_Loot_CloudGiantFinger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Ingredient_Loot_CloudGiantFinger\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c9f4a4f1-7d4e-4958-bc7a-bd7d5dfbd161</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c9f4a4f1-7d4e-4958-bc7a-bd7d5dfbd161\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c9f4a4f1-7d4e-4958-bc7a-bd7d5dfbd161\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by various <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">merchants</a> throughout the game, including (but not limited to):\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Act_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Act 1\">Act 1</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/38px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/50px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Derryth Bonecloak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\">Derryth Bonecloak</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Myconid_Colony\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Myconid Colony\">Myconid Colony</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>) starting at Level 6 (25% chance)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blurg\" title=\"Blurg\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/25px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/38px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/50px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blurg\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/25px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blurg\" title=\"Blurg\">Blurg</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Myconid_Colony\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Myconid Colony\">Myconid Colony</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>) after reaching Level 6</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Act_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Act 2\">Act 2</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoarding_Merregon\" title=\"Hoarding Merregon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png/25px-Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png/38px-Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png/50px-Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hoarding Merregon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png/25px-Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Portrait_Hoarding_Merregon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoarding_Merregon\" title=\"Hoarding Merregon\">Hoarding Merregon</a> inside the <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a></li>\n<li>In the Brewer's Alchemist stash</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Act_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Act 3\">Act 3</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/25px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/38px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/50px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystic Carrion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/25px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\">Mystic Carrion</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stylin%27_Horst\" title=\"Stylin' Horst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Horst.png/25px-Portrait_Horst.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Horst.png/38px-Portrait_Horst.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Horst.png/50px-Portrait_Horst.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stylin' Horst\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Horst.png/25px-Portrait_Horst.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Portrait_Horst.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stylin%27_Horst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stylin' Horst\">Stylin' Horst</a> at his <a href=\"/wiki/The_Velveteen_Elixir\" title=\"The Velveteen Elixir\">Potion Shop</a> in Wyrm's Crossing</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bareki\" title=\"Bareki\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Bareki.png/25px-Portrait_Bareki.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Bareki.png/38px-Portrait_Bareki.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Bareki.png/50px-Portrait_Bareki.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Voiceless Penitent Bareki\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Bareki.png/25px-Portrait_Bareki.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Portrait_Bareki.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bareki\" title=\"Bareki\">Voiceless Penitent Bareki</a>, next to the Undercity Ruins <a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Sigil_Circle\" title=\"Ancient Sigil Circle\">waypoint</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The exact location (<span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-246&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-8</span>) of the Brewer's Alchemist stash is divulged in <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Research_Notes_(Waning_Moon)\" title=\"Research Notes (Waning Moon)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Book_Generic_G_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Research_Notes_(Waning_Moon)\" title=\"Research Notes (Waning Moon)\">Research Notes (Waning Moon)</a>. It is buried under a dirt mound in a patch underneath a house and behind three stacked barrels. This is about halfway between <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing\" title=\"House of Healing\">House of Healing</a> and road to Baldur's Gate landmark to the south.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n